 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Cursed Illusion</em></p>\n<p>You have learned to add a bit of humor to your technique. When a cursed creature sees a distorted face, you can spend 2 CE to force the Intelligence saving throw to be made at disadvantage by making the face look extra goofy. Additionally, you can spend 1 CE to change the distortion, causing them to have to make an additional Intelligence save on their next turn if they see a distorted face.</p>",
